<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Summer Rain</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 4), Druid (guild level 7)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast summer rain</a>
</pre>
<p>Calls down a warm summer rain on everyone in the room, players and monsters 
alike. Each one who is hurt gets back 6 hit points: a little for each, but 
it reaches the whole group at once.
</p><p>It only works under the open sky: indoors, or anywhere without weather, there 
is no possibility of rain. You must be standing. It is also found on wands 
and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cure Light Wounds</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Healers</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Druids</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>